@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="cc-page-head"><h2>@ViewData["Title"]</h2></div>
<div class="cc-card" style="max-width: 720px;">
    <p>CivicConnect stores the details you provide (email address, display name and the service requests you submit) only to run the service. Passwords are stored as salted hashes and are never readable.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Request activity is recorded in an audit trail so that every status change can be traced to the person who made it.</p>
</div>

